sequenceDiagram
    actor U as You
    participant FE as Dashboard (Web App)
    participant Auth as Auth.js
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database (Postgres)
    participant C as Claude Sonnet 5

    U->>FE: Open dashboard
    FE->>Auth: Check session

    alt Not logged in
        Auth->>U: Prompt login (Google, Microsoft, or Apple)
        U->>Auth: Authenticate via provider

        alt Auth succeeds
            Auth->>DB: Save user + account record
            Auth->>FE: Session cookie set
        else Auth fails or denied
            Auth-->>FE: Auth error
            FE->>U: Show error, offer retry
        end
    end

    Auth->>DB: Update lastLoginAt

    FE->>API: Check onboarding status
    API-->>FE: Onboarded?

    alt Not onboarded
        Note over FE,U: New user — see onboarding-flow.mmd
    else Onboarded
        FE->>API: Check for pending check-in
        API-->>FE: Check-in pending?

        alt Check-in pending
            Note over FE,U: Forced digest screen shown first — see check-in-flow.mmd
        else No pending check-in
            FE->>API: Request current week
            API->>Auth: Verify session (JWT)
            Auth-->>API: Valid
            API->>DB: Load existing plan items + draft status

            alt Draft already pending approval
                DB-->>API: Existing pending draft
                API-->>FE: Show existing draft
            else No draft yet this week
                DB-->>API: This week's plan items
                API-->>FE: Show planning view

                FE->>U: "What do you want this week? (gaming, date night, gym...)"
                U->>FE: Enter weekly priorities

                FE->>API: Submit priorities
                API->>C: Send plan items + priorities

                alt Claude call succeeds
                    C-->>API: Draft schedule
                    API->>DB: Create WeeklyPlan (PENDING)
                    API-->>FE: Show draft
                else Claude call fails or times out
                    API-->>FE: Show error, offer retry
                end
            end

            alt Approves
                U->>FE: Approve
                FE->>API: Save schedule
                API->>DB: Write final schedule
            else Requests changes
                U->>FE: Adjust ("move gaming to Thursday")
                FE->>API: Re-send with adjustment
                API->>C: Regenerate
                C-->>API: Revised draft
                API->>DB: Update existing WeeklyPlan draft
                API-->>FE: Show revised draft
            end
        end
    end
